  "title": "Division by Zero.",
  "body": " Division by Zero   Dividing 5.0 \/ 0.0 in Java throws an ArithmeticException , just like 5 \/ 0 .    False. Integer division by zero ( 5 \/ 0 ) throws ArithmeticException , whereas floating-point division ( 5.0 \/ 0.0 ) evaluates to Infinity .   "
