  "id": "fig-8-6-use-case-stamp-requests",
  "level": "2",
  "url": "sec-8-3-use-cases.html#fig-8-6-use-case-stamp-requests",
  "type": "Figure",
  "number": "8.11",
  "title": "",
  "body": " A use case diagram showing use cases in the library reading program software related to stamp requests.   UML use case diagram with Librarian and Reader actors connected to stamp request use cases.   A UML use case diagram showing a rectangular system boundary box titled \"Library Reading Program Stamp Requests.\" Outside on the left is a stick figure labeled Librarian connected by a solid line to an oval inside the box labeled \"Set stamp minutes cost.\" Outside on the right is a stick figure labeled Reader connected by solid lines to two ovals inside the box labeled \"Request stamp\" and \"Choose stamp.\"    "
